{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_040_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6bd246d806eb5d311765e241f9e7d438bf5cdd6818c57f79d3bab017a8dbcdde",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5522211eb4247de4c045f5cf09cf3d66101ec7e42f49d8bd42e95ce757477fdc",
      "text": "涟先生，请用！这是您托我买的鲷鱼烧。\n用之前的商品券买回来的。还有就是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58a54e76d6d805f36699e36cd8cd64f3daf85656a9daf644a69c5d19d99801d4",
      "text": "早间日常视频好像已经制作完成了。\n我们一起来确认一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:161e85961aefebd661ce08e8b5712220695d512213d74059a8f3c0bc3d3d68e3",
      "text": "听说做得很棒哦。一边吃鲷鱼烧\n一边看吧！饮料也准备好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aab6193d80906e4b4e96dc7d98bb7e256699a2ac8c5640cd9ebcb045892a6800",
      "text": "我才没兴趣……\n你自己一个人看去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:380c76ad004406bec85d8afd99bbf2c47a4c635c58f7bf9bbb5832c8189191b1",
      "text": "别这么说嘛。\n那么，我播放了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07970a66fcc02e643d933fe2ece07dcc2c03d3ecd9bc2f3924972591c147d8fd",
      "text": "“本大爷醒来的时间就是早晨。\n让太阳自己来配合我！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5091307f8dc2c3c6666034595a03ee73767bff4f8eaba27dbbf3148b8b96d433",
      "text": "在舒适宜人的气候中醒来，偶像牙崎涟……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbaeb6ded95f52fa7fe190f137e19f195e188c40d15206c619f10c1a3c30798c",
      "text": "“这不有现成的好东西嘛。\n今天的早饭就是那个了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdaba513d717c5c1e032b17be32517ae0f0fd513e48f1025dd92da07211f8fa5",
      "text": "偶然发现的大赛，惊喜参与其中。\n作为处于成长期的偶像，牙崎大显身手……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1556f392b7533837b822808066ac4f0c8d7a608e5ef7474465ba235f596c8871",
      "text": "“喂，拿去替我收着”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0512880082cba3d7cbdab4a999bf4eeec08ec78ba7ba12817e41fac9cac357b3",
      "text": "在胜利与喝彩声中享用完早餐的他，\n将生活费的管理全权托付给了信任的对象……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2b2cb881fbfbecb1124e678bf42231d331de622f2ec8b6a798820d69b0cdd95",
      "text": "偶像牙崎涟的早晨，便是如此豪放磊落……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:402219735fecb29f26c039a1c17f14837874aa3eae532746981d52c1865d181f",
      "text": "感觉成品剪辑得相当前卫时髦呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac9c1ec14bf640c20c3b9e42f1533771a25cc9463403178a680d6455060d6f00",
      "text": "哼！马马虎虎算干得不错嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:342d4ace080f20d23a9d1bad9dd6503d4270b774d8bccd89fe4deefe8c28d78b",
      "text": "这样一来本大爷是最强大天才这件事，\n又要传遍全世界了！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
